[00:13.099]If I had to live my life without you near me
{"若我此生无法与你相伴"}
[00:18.399]The days would all be empty
{"每一天都将空虚荒芜"}
[00:23.399]The nights would seem so long
{"漫漫长夜永无止境"}
[00:27.000]With you I see forever oh so clearly
{"与你相守的未来如此清晰"}
[00:31.700]I might have been in love before
{"或许我曾经历过爱情"}
[00:36.200]But it never felt this strong
{"但从未如此刻骨铭心"}
[00:39.900]Our dreams are young and we both know
{"我们的梦想正年轻"}
[00:44.100]They'll take us where we want to go
{"会带我们抵达心之所向"}
[00:46.620]Hold me now touch me now
{"此刻拥抱我 触碰我"}
[00:50.220]I don't want to live without you
{"我无法想象没有你的生活"}
[00:55.160]Nothing's gonna change my love for you
{"此爱永不渝"}
[00:58.210]You ought to know by now how much I love you
{"你早该明了我的深情"}
[01:02.200]One thing you can be sure of
{"唯有一事你可确信"}
[01:05.200]I never ask for more than your love
{"我别无所求 只要你的爱"}
[01:08.700]Nothing's gonna change my love for you
{"此爱永不渝"}
[01:11.900]You oughta know by now how much I love you
{"你早该明了我的深情"}
[01:15.200]The world may change my whole life through but
{"纵使世界天翻地覆"}
[01:18.200]Nothing's gonna change my love for you
{"此爱永不渝"}
[01:25.200]If the road ahead is not so easy
{"若前方路途坎坷崎岖"}
[01:30.200]Our love will lead a way for us
{"我们的爱会指引方向"}
[01:35.200]Like a guiding star
{"如北斗星辰"}
[01:38.500]I'll be there for you if you should need me
{"只要你需要 我必在身边"}
[01:43.500]Kian:You don''t have to change a thing
{"你无需改变任何事"}
[01:48.500]I love you just the way you are
